@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title UC-Retail — Purchase a Ready Ring
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

start
|Guest or Member|
:Browse ready rings and select one item;
|System|
if (Authenticated Member?) then (yes)
  :Show order summary and full amount due;
  |Member|
  :Confirm purchase and start payment;
  |Payment Gateway|
  :Process full retail payment;
  |System|
  if (Valid payment confirmation received?) then (yes)
    :Record verified PaymentTransaction;
    :Create RetailOrder;
    :Reserve one ready-ring unit;
    |Member|
    :Choose pickup or third-party delivery handoff;
    if (Pickup) then (yes)
      |System|
      :Set order status to pickup-ready / preparing;
    else (handoff)
      |Staff / Consultant|
      :Complete third-party handoff;
      :Record carrier, handoff reference, actor and timestamp;
      |System|
      :Set order status to handed to carrier;
    endif
    |Email Sender|
    :Send order/status notification;
    |System|
    :Show order and transaction in Member history;
  else (pending, failed or invalid)
    :Keep order payment unconfirmed;
    :Do not reserve the item;
    :Show pending / unconfirmed-payment status;
  endif
else (no)
  :Block Buy Now;
  :Explain that retail checkout requires Member status;
  |Guest|
  :Sign in or register;
  |System|
  :Return to the selected ready-ring detail after success;
endif

note right
The reservation has no automatic expiry in V1. Carrier tracking, delivery failure, return and logistics refund are out of scope.
end note
stop
@enduml
